# sen0401_ch10_book_extract_v1_0_0.ttl - the book part of chapter 10 as the SEN0401 chapter 10 page carries it. Derived from mastering_bitcoin_3e_ch10_v1_1_0.ttl of altunelyusuf/mastering-bitcoin (3e/01-ontologies, commit eb58328). Two details of the authors' text differ, both by the course rulings of 2026-11-14 and 2026-11-24: the opening words of the sentence on Alice and Bob read 'Suppose that' where the book has another verb, and two dotted lines in the JSON listing are written with the ellipsis sign. The package file is unchanged.
