mbb:Concept_DNS_seeds mbb:introducedIn mbb:Chapter_10 ; mbb:introducedBy mbb:Passage_ch10_DNS_seeds .
mbb:Passage_ch10_DNS_seeds a mbb:Passage ; rdfs:label "Where The Bitcoin Network first indexes DNS seeds"@en ; mbb:inPart mbb:Chapter_10 ; mbb:text "The first method is to query DNS using a number of DNS seeds, which are DNS servers that provide a list of IP addresses of Bitcoin nodes." ; mbb:sourceLine 287 ; mbb:sourceFile "ch10_network.adoc" ; mbb:pinnedCommit "275c4eb8eab8800c6adc39f8def8e8f8fa356a57" ; dcterms:source mbb:Work ; dcterms:creator "Andreas M. Antonopoulos", "David A. Harding" ; dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/> .
